{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I have a strong lead. Chigozie Obioma was born in Akure, Nigeria. His novels \"The Fishermen\" (2015) and \"An Orchestra of Minorities\" (2019) were shortlisted for the Booker Prize and translated into 30 languages.\n\nBut wait - the Booker Prize was established in 1969, not the 2000s. The puzzle says the award was \"originally created in the 2000s.\" Let me reconsider. The Man Booker International Prize was created in 2005 (2000s). But Obioma's novels were shortlisted for the regular Booker Prize, not the International one.\n\nLet me reconsider the puzzle. Maybe the award is the Man Asian Literary Prize (created 2007). Let me check if Obioma was a contender for that. Or maybe I need to look at this differently - perhaps the \"award created in the 2000s\" is a different award.\n\nLet me search for more details about Obioma's awards and the Man Asian Literary Prize.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Chigozie Obioma Man Asian Literary Prize\", \"Man Asian Literary Prize created 2007 winners\", \"Chigozie Obioma awards nominations full list\"]}","name":"search"},"id":"call_771279bb96804f9dab9c22c1","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"literary award created 2005 2006 2007 2008 2009 book translated 25 languages\", \"award founded 2000s novel translated over twenty five languages contender\"]}","name":"search"},"id":"call_aede7cd618504a4095226bf5","index":1,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789478230,"id":"chatcmpl-77a3266d-be0d-9a03-bde0-5b871ee3b021","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":13856,"completion_tokens":306,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":14162,"cached_tokens":8832,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":8832},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}